            <ArticleTitle>Six-minute walking test in children.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1586-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/09638288.2012.742576</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="IMPLICATIONS FOR REHABILITATION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">Six-minute walking test. The six-minute walking test is safe and widely performed in the world because of its easy implementation and low cost. Many countries have established normal values to the six-minute walking test in healthy children. However, the applicability of this test also gains popularity among children with other disease conditions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
